{
  "text": "On this day, September 11th: In 2011: A dedication ceremony is held at the United States National September 11 Memorial on the 10th anniversary of the September 11 attacks in New York City, and the memorial opens to family members. In 2025: Former Brazilian president Jair Bolsonaro was sentenced to 27 years in prison for his involvement in a coup plot. And in 1995: Mir EO-19, the first expedition to the Russian space station Mir launched on an American Space Shuttle, returned to Earth after approximately 75 days in space.",
